| Code | Meaning               | Example  |
| ---- | --------------------- | -------- |
| `%Y` | Full year             | 2026     |
| `%y` | Year (2 digits)       | 26       |
| `%m` | Month (01–12)         | 03       |
| `%B` | Full month name       | March    |
| `%b` | Short month name      | Mar      |
| `%d` | Day of month (01–31)  | 26       |
| `%A` | Full weekday name     | Thursday |
| `%a` | Short weekday name    | Thu      |
| `%w` | Weekday (0=Sunday)    | 4        |
| `%j` | Day of year (001–366) | 085      |


| Code | Meaning        | Example |
| ---- | -------------- | ------- |
| `%H` | Hour (24-hour) | 14      |
| `%I` | Hour (12-hour) | 02      |
| `%p` | AM/PM          | PM      |
| `%M` | Minute (00–59) | 05      |
| `%S` | Second (00–59) | 09      |
| `%f` | Microseconds   | 123456  |



| Code | Meaning          | Example                  |
| ---- | ---------------- | ------------------------ |
| `%c` | Full date & time | Thu Mar 26 14:05:09 2026 |
| `%x` | Locale date      | 03/26/26                 |
| `%X` | Locale time      | 14:05:09                 |


| Format          | Output Example           |
| --------------- | ------------------------ |
| `%Y-%m-%d`      | 2026-03-26               |
| `%d/%m/%Y`      | 26/03/2026               |
| `%A, %B %d, %Y` | Thursday, March 26, 2026 |
| `%I:%M %p`      | 02:05 PM                 |
| `%H:%M:%S`      | 14:05:09                 |
